	(text "PIO link to the ECP5 (E-link.md): 8-bit, 37.5 MHz,\n22R series at each driver is in the FPGA design rule;\nLINK_* tri-stated while the FPGA is configured.\nENC_*: encoder header on the io sheet (block G pulls)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 205.74 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "82e54653-b10e-44b3-ba86-a7c79715c48f")
	)
	(text "SSPI configuration (SPI1): FPGA_CCLK 33R at the RP2350,\npad set to 8 mA (1k pull-up at the FPGA).\nReads <= 18.75 MHz, bitstream writes 37.5 MHz.\nIBUS_SENSE: 100n at the pin (B's 67k source, 24 Hz).\nILIM_SEL0/1, VDRV_EN: reset Hi-Z, pulled down\nat blocks B and C (safe state)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.18 205.74 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "21b22bec-ae36-430b-bcd0-c7ec604e7429")
	)
